@startuml F1.17-D01-listar-eventos
title F1.17-D01 — Listar eventos
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "EventsController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: abre /eventos
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /events?audience=me
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT eventos
Postgres --> Ctrl: lista + situacaoPresenca
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Aluno: tabela\n(+ badge Janela aberta)

@enduml
